{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50358","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十一、贞女台咏[二三] · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十一、贞女台咏[二三]","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贞女谁家女？\n孤标坐[二四]此台。\n青蛾随月转[二五]，红粉向花开。\n二八无人识，千秋已作灰。\n洁身终不嫁，非爲乏良媒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}